This product includes software developed by Sahil Bachu (https://github.com/SahilBachu/skill-issue).

The approved skill index (src/skillissue/data/approved-index.json) contains names, descriptions
and short excerpts of third-party Agent Skills under their own licenses. See
src/skillissue/data/APPROVED_NOTICES.md for sources and licenses.

The benchmark uses the SkillRet dataset (ThakiCloud/SKILLRET, Apache-2.0) and public skill
repositories pinned in data/corpus/sources.lock.json. Skill content is not redistributed in
this repository; only metadata and hashes are committed.
